The recent question about Juiblex got me wondering about who I'd least like
to encounter in a NetHack game.  Here are some of the candidates:

Orcus: 120 HP, AC -6, 85% MR, 98 pts.  Pretty obvious why he's a bad guy.

Yeenoghu: 100 HP, AC -5, 80% magic resistance, up to 52 pts. damage.  As if
all this weren't enough, Yeenoghu has powers of paralysis and confusion.

Demogorgon: 200 HP, AC -8, 95% MR, 64 pts.  Also random spells, level drain
and 2 disease attacks.

Just for fun, I went into wizard mode, got a ring of conflict, created both
Yeenoghu and Demogorgon, and watched them tear each other apart.  Turns out
that Yeenoghu won every time, mainly because poor Demogorgon kept getting
paralyzed.  Fortunately I'm not about to run into any of these guys, but it
helps to know when bribes are worthwhile.

